   "dur": 2.56,
   "speech": "书里的式三之十四。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 2,
   "start": 249.64,
   "dur": 5.37,
   "speech": "第 l 层第 t 个位置，是上一层若干抽头的加权和。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 3,
   "start": 255.19,
   "dur": 5.27,
   "speech": "抽头的位置是 t 减去核宽减一减 k，再乘膨胀因子。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 4,
   "start": 260.64,
   "dur": 2.97,
   "speech": "k 从零数到核宽减一。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 5,
   "start": 263.78,
   "dur": 3.04,
   "speech": "k 等于零时，抽头最旧。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 6,
   "start": 267,
   "dur": 2.68,
   "speech": "这个次序很容易写反。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 7,
   "start": 269.86,
   "dur": 4.07,
   "speech": "写反了，因果性还在，但权重对不上。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 8,
   "start": 274.11,
   "dur": 3.54,
   "speech": "因果性只靠一件事：左边补零。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 9,
   "start": 277.83,
   "dur": 4.19,
   "speech": "补多少？核宽减一，乘膨胀因子。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 10,
   "start": 282.2,
   "dur": 2.44,
   "speech": "右边一个都不补。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 11,
   "start": 284.82,
   "dur": 4.24,
   "speech": "所以第 t 个输出最多看到第 t 个输入。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 12,
   "start": 289.24,
   "dur": 3.18,
   "speech": "感受野不是核宽，是累加。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 13,
   "start": 292.6,
   "dur": 4.48,
   "speech": "一加，各层核宽减一乘膨胀因子的和。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 14,
   "start": 297.26,
   "dur": 3.54,
   "speech": "四层核宽三，膨胀一二四八。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 15,
   "start": 300.98,
   "dur": 4,
   "speech": "一加二加四加八，再乘二，等于三十。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 16,
   "start": 305.16,
   "dur": 2.46,
   "speech": "再加一，三十一。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 17,
   "start": 307.8,
   "dur": 3.54,
   "speech": "注意，是按层累加，不是乘起来。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 18,
   "start": 311.52,
   "dur": 2.32,
   "speech": "第二件事：频率。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 19,
   "start": 314.02,
   "dur": 4.19,
   "speech": "书里式三之十六，对序列做 FFT。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 20,
   "start": 318.39,
   "dur": 2.85,
   "speech": "取振幅最大的 k 个频率。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 21,
   "start": 321.41,
   "dur": 3.57,
   "speech": "书里写 k 是预定义的超参数。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 22,
   "start": 325.16,
   "dur": 3.16,
   "speech": "我们的口径：去掉直流分量。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 23,
   "start": 328.5,
   "dur": 3.81,
   "speech": "只取正频率，实部虚部拼成向量。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 24,
   "start": 332.48,
   "dur": 4.29,
   "speech": "每个峰值的周期，是窗长除以频率序号。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 25,
   "start": 336.95,
   "dur": 3.73,
   "speech": "再四舍五入，夹在二到窗长之间。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 26,
   "start": 340.86,
   "dur": 2.89,
   "speech": "四十八根等于一个交易日。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 27,
   "start": 343.94,
   "dur": 2.51,
   "speech": "二十四根等于半天。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 28,
   "start": 346.63,
   "dur": 3.52,
   "speech": "这是物理尺度，不是调参调出来的。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 29,
   "start": 350.33,
   "dur": 3.06,
   "speech": "第三件事：折叠成二维。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 30,
   "start": 353.57,
   "dur": 5.01,
   "speech": "式三之十七，把一维序列折成周期乘相位。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 31,
   "start": 358.75,
   "dur": 4.17,
   "speech": "窗长九十六，周期四十八，折成两行。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 32,
   "start": 363.1,
   "dur": 3.13,
   "speech": "行是周期序号，列是相位。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 33,
   "start": 366.41,
   "dur": 4.43,
   "speech": "列方向是环形：相位走完一圈回到开头。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 34,
   "start": 371.02,
   "dur": 4.21,
   "speech": "行方向不是环形：周期轴到头就是边界。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 35,
   "start": 375.42,
   "dur": 4.17,
   "speech": "所以二维卷积只在列方向循环。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 36,
   "start": 379.76,
   "dur": 2.56,
   "speech": "行方向用零填充。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 37,
   "start": 382.5,
   "dur": 3.76,
   "speech": "这一步写错，输出会串到另一个周期。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 38,
   "start": 386.44,
   "dur": 2.08,
   "speech": "最后是聚合。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 39,
   "start": 388.7,
   "dur": 3.78,
   "speech": "式三之十八，按振幅加权求和。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 40,
   "start": 392.66,
   "dur": 5.39,
   "speech": "书里排版写成 A 下标 l，求和项是 A 下标 i。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 41,
   "start": 398.23,
   "dur": 3.4,
   "speech": "我们按语义读成 A 下标 i。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 42,
   "start": 401.81,
   "dur": 3.76,
   "speech": "并且归一化，让权重和等于一。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 43,
   "start": 405.75,
   "dur": 4.33,
   "speech": "不归一化，周期数一变，输出幅度就变。"
  },
